e=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">但之前走弱</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">并不代表之后就弱</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">；</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">之前走强也不一定之后就强</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">尤其上个视频</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">我们刚复盘历史上</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">1</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">月份变盘概率非常高！如果不提前布局板块切换、风格切换的速度也会非常快</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"line-height: 1.5em;text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">风险提示：</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">刘广义：</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span leaf=\"\"> </span><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\">A0630624060004</span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">，观点策略及分析仅供参考，不作为投资依据，若据此操作风险自担。</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">投资有风险</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">入市需谨慎！</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p></div>",
